CoW intents
├── SebaCowIntentModule constructor/configureLimits/setEnabled
│   ├── Invalid authority/code/decimals/token graph/domain/relayer → revert
│   ├── Disabled defaults, finite nonzero caps, TTL and Safe-only configuration
│   └── Pausing prevents opens but does not revoke authorized outstanding orders
├── predictEscrow/order/orderUid/orderData
│   ├── Prediction independent of quote limit/quantity, nonce guards stale quote owner
│   └── Immutable canonical SELL/FOK/zero-fee/ERC20 order and exact domain UID
├── openOrder
│   ├── Only manager; one active per each of four immutable sources
│   ├── Zero/oversize/minimum/expiry/TTL/value/nonce mismatches → atomic revert
│   ├── WETH wrapping or harvested-rETH pull with exact measured deltas
│   └── Clone initialized once, finite approval, presign only for stored order
├── closeOrder / escrow.close
│   ├── Full finite allowance spent + enough BOLD → exactly-once same-purpose gross BOLD
│   ├── No input spent + operator before expiry → pending
│   ├── No input spent + Safe cancel or past expiry → exact original input refund
│   ├── Partial spend/short output/token delta fault → fail closed and no state advance
│   ├── filledAmount cleanup does not erase finite-spend proof
│   └── Revoked presign/zero allowance/closed flag prevent replay and double credit
├── sweepOrderSurplus / escrow.sweep
│   ├── Unauthorized or still open → revert
│   ├── Unfilled donated BOLD cannot fake fill; terminal surplus only to fixed Safe
│   └── Forced ETH, ERC20 surplus, transfer failures and initializer lock
├── YieldManagerV2 openCowOrder/finalizeCowOrder/deployYsyProtocolPrincipal
│   ├── Sources: reward ETH / ysy principal ETH / supporter rETH carry / protocol rETH carry
│   ├── Debit source on open, restore original source only on refund
│   ├── Principal BOLD distinct from donated reward BOLD; no second ETH debit
│   ├── Direct Yearn measured shares and yBOLD basis; no arbitrary target/calldata
│   ├── Pending orders must finish/cancel before module replacement or buffer recovery
│   └── All four concurrent orders close independently/out of order, including paused
├── SebaV2DirectExecutor
│   ├── Every authority/identity/limit/paused/deadline and disabled DEX route
│   ├── Rocket registry/report/fee/capacity/canonical floor and exact output
│   └── Nested Yearn deposits/redemptions, zero-loss policy, exact inputs/outputs/approval cleanup
└── Fuzz/invariants/fork
    ├── Per-source conservation, source attribution, custody, no double credit, no replay
    ├── Handler positive reachability and injected custody-leak negative control
    └── Real deployed CoW/relayer/WETH/rETH semantics with impersonated solver/synthetic BOLD
